Package: parkeze-ap
Version: @VERSION@-@BUILD@
Depends: ucode, ucode-mod-uci, hostapd-basic-mbedtls, wpa-supplicant-mbedtls, iw, dnsmasq-full, jsonfilter
Source: parkeze
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: Setup access point and captive portal.
 Raises a self-titled access point so a gateway can be reconfigured when it has
 dropped off the network, with a captive portal that joins a WiFi network or
 hands the unit back to LAN configuration. Open only while the gateway has no
 credentials to lose; WPA2 with a per-device key once it is adopted.
